# Admin App Framework Documentation (JSON UI Focused)

Welcome! This documentation covers the Admin App framework, with a primary focus on its **JSON UI system** for building user interfaces.

> **Note: ** This documentation is undergoing restructuring. Common framework/concept documentation is being moved to [`docs/`](/docs/). The main `docs/` directory focuses on project-specific aspects and serves as an entry point. Cleanup of outdated information is ongoing.

## Project Goals

The primary goal is to develop a modular, scalable Admin Panel using Laravel, Vue 3, and Inertia, powered by a flexible JSON UI engine. A key supporting goal is to maintain comprehensive, accurate, and well-structured documentation to enhance developer productivity and experience.

See the full [Project Overview](prj-mgmt/project-overview.md) for detailed objectives, tech stack, and rationale.

