- **To understand the backend: ** Explore [Core Backend (`docs/core/`)](/docs/core/README.md), especially the [AiRudeDepot Overview](/docs/core/AiRudeDepot/README.md).
- **To understand general module development concepts: ** See the [Module Guides (`docs/guides/module/`)](/docs/guides/module/). *(Note: Specific implementation examples reside in `implement-modules/`)*
- **For practical checklists: ** See the [Checklists Overview (`checklists/README.md`)](checklists/README.md).
- **For development workflows & processes: ** See the [Processes Overview (`docs/processes/README.md`)](/docs/processes/README.md).
- **To see planned changes (V2): ** Review the documents within [`_planning/`](_planning/).
- **To learn about standards: ** Browse the [Standards Overview (`docs/standards/README.md`)](/docs/standards/README.md).
- **To track project status/issues: ** Look in [Project Management (`prj-mgmt/`)](prj-mgmt/).

