## Core JSON UI Concepts

- **Components**: UI elements defined in JSON (See [UI Elements Overview](/docs/ui/resources/elements/README.md))
- **Sources**: External JSON files included via `include` operation (See [JSON UI Core Concepts](/docs/ui/json-ui/core-concepts/README.md))
- **Actions & Operations**: Server/client functionality triggered from the UI (See [Commands and Operations Overview](/docs/ui/json-ui/commands-and-operations/README.md))
- **Events & Hooks**: User interactions triggering actions (See [Frontend Managers Overview](/docs/ui/resources/managers/README.md))
- **Buffers/Sessions**: Client/Server-side data storage (Conceptual - See [Storage Support Overview](/docs/core/AiRudeDepot/Support/README.md) for related details)

