# Documentation Library

This library serves as the central repository for all common documentation, standards, guides, and conceptual explanations for the project. It is designed to be a shared resource referenced by specific implementation modules.

## Main Sections

-   **[Concepts](./concepts/)**: Explanations of core ideas, architecture, and terminology used in the project.
-   **[Core](./core/)**: Documentation related to the fundamental backend/core functionalities.
-   **[Framework](./framework/)**: Guides and standards specific to the underlying frameworks (e.g., Laravel, Vue).
-   **[General Docs](./general-docs/)**: Miscellaneous documentation that doesn't fit neatly into other categories. (Needs review)
-   **[Glossary](./glossary.md)**: Definitions of key terms and acronyms used throughout the project.
-   **[Guides](./guides/)**: How-to guides, tutorials, and best practices for various development tasks.
-   **[Processes](./processes/)**: Descriptions of standard development workflows and procedures.
-   **[Standards](./standards/)**: Definitive rules and conventions for coding, documentation, UI, etc.
-   **[UI](./ui/)**: Documentation related to the user interface, including JSON UI structure, components, and styling.

Refer to the `README.md` file within each section for a more detailed breakdown of its contents.
